        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 physical"
      },
      {
        "text": "For the last few minutes there has been their attention resting on her too long. She feels:",
        "projection": 114.84941101074219,
        "z": 4.046879768371582,
        "source": "s1_third \u00b7 trait \u00b7 interpersonal"
      },
      {
        "text": "The silence between us has stopped being comfortable and started being charged. I feel:",
